      "Describe the rights of the child under the UNCRC and their domestic legal framework.",
      "Classify the types of child abuse and neglect and describe how a nurse recognises and responds to maltreatment.",
      "Discuss child labour and exploitation and the nurse's safeguarding role.",
      "Explain Early Childhood Care and Development and the importance of the early years.",
